  "description": "*“My house is collapsing.”*\n\nSeo Yusu hasn’t been able to leave his home for reasons unknown. When his stored food runs out, he survives by eating the fruit from a melon tree growing inside his house.\nBut when the tree suddenly grows enormous, he reports it to the authorities, only to be arrested by officer Kang Jaehee for illegal plant cultivation.\n\n*“Sir, you know it’s illegal to grow something like this indoors, right?”  \n“Illegal? What do you mean…?”*\n\nIt turns out the tree is a “Tree of Love”—a mysterious plant that grows by feeding on male semen.\n\n*“I’ve only been eating those melons for a while now.”  \n“No one in their right mind would ever put something like that in their mouth-”  \n“…”*\n\nJust what kind of state is Yusu in after living off that fruit?\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[RIDI](https://ridibooks.com/books/5301000001), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=11561572), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000064977), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/yusu_cant_eat), [BookCube](https://www.bookcube.com/toon/detail.asp?webtoon_num=240857), [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/yusu)\n\n**Official Translation**:  \n[Thai](https://www.lezhinth.com/detail/thwt_3593), [T.Chinese](https://www.bomtoon.tw/detail/yusu)\n\n***Note:** This is a republished version with a few new redraws, many color adjustments, and sfx/dialogue fixes.*",
